<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 1,200 tonnes of lead.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 1,200 tonnes of lead.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 1,200 tonnes of lead for $767,449.</p>
<p>The buyers were Amerway, East Penn Manufacturing, Canfield Technologies, Ney Smelting &amp; Refining, Parks-Pioneer Metals Company, T R Metals, Non-Ferrous Processing, Lead Products Co, and Specialty Metals &amp; Minerals.</p>
<p>The next offer of Stockpile lead will be on June 5.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
